    hints: ['Run it and read the error message. It points at a position in the text.', 'JSON is stricter than JavaScript: keys and strings need double quotes.', 'Use single quotes around the JS string and double quotes inside it, or escape them: \'{"name":"Ada","age":36}\'.'],
